%% VersionTag: 2608.B1.V54.0
%% FileRole: Diagram
%% Source plan: ~README.md/CRON-PIPE-FLOW-PLAN.md
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dev as Developer / Cron
    participant RFP as Run-FullPipeline.ps1
    participant Tests as tests/Run-AllTests.ps1
    participant Gate as Invoke-PipelineFlowGraphGate.ps1
    participant Ext as PwShGUI-PipelineFlowGraph.psm1
    participant Sync as Sync-CronPipeFlowViewerData.ps1
    participant View as XHTML-Cron-Pipe-Flow.xhtml
    participant Git as Commit / Task completion

    Dev->>RFP: Invoke pipeline
    RFP->>RFP: Steps 1-8 version, manifests, SIN scan
    RFP->>Tests: Blocking full Pester suite
    Tests-->>RFP: PASS required
    RFP->>Gate: Step 12 FlowGraph gate
    Gate->>Ext: Get-PipelineFlowGraph -WorkspacePath
    Ext-->>Gate: nodes / edges / glossary + graphHash
    Gate->>Gate: Compare graphHash vs baseline
    alt Drift detected and -FailOnDrift
        Gate-->>RFP: Exit 1 with drift report
        RFP-->>Dev: BLOCKED - resolve or -UpdateBaseline
    else Clean or baseline updated
        Gate->>Sync: Emit pipeline-flow-graph.json
        Sync->>View: Inject FLOW_GRAPH_DATA JS block
        Sync-->>RFP: viewer synced at current VersionTag
        RFP-->>Git: Allow completion / commit
    end
